
config NE_L2FP
	bool "L2 Fast Path management"
	default n
	---help---
	  The L2 Fast Path module is using the CPU ports as interface between
	  L2FE and 3rd Party OS Network Device Driver. This module is only
	  needed for the Soc which L2FE supports the CPU ports for L2 mac
	  learning/flooding.

